s pollution and clear  its skies this year China is expected to  pass the US and become the largest  consumer market by 2030 it's expected to  generate three times as much waste as  the US and as China becomes more and  more important on the world stage all of  us will fall into two categories those  who understand it for whom this is a  great opportunity and those who are left  behind my favorite book for getting a  feel for what the country is really like  and where it may go in the future is  China in the 21st century by Jeffrey  Wasser strum I read it while researching  this video and I recommend it it's only  five hours long and you can listen to it  on audible let's be real we all have  busy lives and it's kind of hard to find  an hour or two during the day where you  can just sit down and read but it's easy  to just put on an audiobook on the way  to school or work or while doing chores  or writing long rambling YouTube  comments not that you guys would do that  what I like about this book in  particular is that it's a nice general  overview of China it doesn't pretend to  know the future and it doesn't have some  kind of agenda it's just a  straightforward objective explanation go  to audible.com slash poly matter or text  poly matter to 500 500 to start  listening to this book or whatever  you're into for free again that's  audible.com slash pol Y ma tter  or text pol ym8 e ter to five zero zero  five zero zero

